  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24 Programme of Carnegie China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s expected effect(s) on society are through research and programming, greater understanding between China and countries around the world has been fostered, mistrust has been reduced, and an environment conducive for cooperation on pressing issues facing the world has been created (Impact). 

The expected effects for the target group of the Project are: identification of effective solutions to  shared global challenges between Chinese and international experts, and capacity building and leadership development for the next generation of Chinese scholars and young international leaders (Outcome). 

The intended target group is both the public and key stakeholders in government, academia, and media who can shape the current and future debate on Chinese foreign policy and help facilitate a more constructive U.S.-China relationship.</narrative>
  </description>
